{"lyrics":"[Intro]\n[00:00.68] This bitch, Taz you hear me foe? I'm finna eat! (808 Mafia)\n[00:03.80] G-Money you hear me foe? I'm finna eat!\n[00:05.96] Max Lord you hear me foe? I'm finna eat, ha!\n[Verse 1]\n[00:10.72] My niggas all in, ballin'\n[00:13.04] Fucking hoes, we ain't calling or talking\n[00:15.72] They follow us, they get to stalking\n[00:17.98] She gon' top me up right after I park it\n[00:20.64] She asked to hit my blunt, bitch, I just sparked it\n[00:23.46] This-this that Kimbo OG, this that cough shit\n[00:26.32] I bought a zip of that stank, smell like toxic\n[00:29.28] Hair-trigger on that choppa, like a off switch\n[00:32.10] Red beam on your head, you a target (You a target)\n[00:35.16] I walk my shit, I don't talk it\n[00:37.82] I'm a dog, bite down, I don't bark it\n[00:40.64] Omega Psi Phi, if we fighting, I'ma get to stomping, I'ma get to stomping (Stomping)\n[00:46.22] Put the slimes on your ass, like Bompton\n[00:49.02] Fuck nigga cross the line, then it's slaughter\n[00:51.94] Old niggas hold on to your daughters\n[00:54.16] Cause if she hear one song, that bitch a goner\n[00:57.16] D-D-damn, stutter of the Percs like, ye-yeah\n[01:00.82] .40 make 'em jerk like that Cali' dance\n[01:03.70] Versace palm trees, I'm rocking these Cali' pants\n[01:06.70] Me and Max Lord taking the Klonopins\n[01:09.54] That's a Benzo, Xan for the dumb niggas, they ain't never understand\n[01:13.52] I done took a lot of Xans\n[01:15.14] Cut it out for a while, get back on 'em, time to relapse again (Again)\n[Chorus]\n[01:21.02] Cut it out for a while, get back on 'em, time to relapse again (Again)\n[01:32.10] Cut it out for a while, get back on 'em, time to relapse again (Again)\n[Verse 2]\n[01:43.40] Passed out at her house, woke up sleeping on the front lawn again\n[01:49.04] Foreign bitch, I don't know where she from, I just call her Mulan, yeah\n[01:53.86] I got green like a lawn, yeah\n[01:56.44] Fendi on the design, yeah\n[01:59.30] Moncler on me, like I crack cards\n[02:01.70] I used to crack cards, now I just crack broads\n[02:04.80] Y-R-N\n[02:06.68] right, young rich nigga, that's for life\n[02:10.22] My dick all in your wife\n[02:13.02] Fuck her off the Percs, it's gon' be a long night\n[Chorus]\n[02:28.58] Cut it out for a while, get back on 'em, time to relapse again (Again)\n[02:32.96] (808 Mafia)\n[02:34.02] Cut it out for a while, get back on 'em, time to relapse again (Again)","words":[[0.1,0.36,"[Intro]"],[0.38,0.42,"[00:01.04]"],[0.68,0.96,"This"],[1.04,1.42,"bitch,"],[1.56,1.68,"Taz"],[1.74,1.78,"you"],[1.86,1.94,"hear"],[2.02,2.08,"me"],[2.2,2.3,"foe?"],[2.34,2.48,"I'm"],[2.56,2.72,"finna"],[2.76,2.84,"eat!"],[2.86,2.94,"(808"],[3.04,3.34,"Mafia)"],[3.36,3.52,"[00:03.80]"],[3.8,4.16,"G-Money"],[4.2,4.26,"you"],[4.36,4.44,"hear"],[4.52,4.58,"me"],[4.7,5.04,"foe?"],[5.08,5.12,"I'm"],[5.18,5.42,"finna"],[5.68,5.82,"eat!"],[5.84,5.9,"[00:05.96]"],[5.96,6.12,"Max"],[6.24,6.36,"Lord"],[6.4,6.48,"you"],[6.56,6.66,"hear"],[6.7,6.78,"me"],[6.9,7.02,"foe?"],[7.06,7.1,"I'm"],[7.2,7.44,"finna"],[7.64,7.76,"eat,"],[8.0,8.08,"ha!"],[8.26,10.36,"[Verse"],[10.38,10.4,"1]"],[10.4,10.44,"[00:10.72]"],[10.72,10.84,"My"],[10.92,11.26,"niggas"],[11.5,11.64,"all"],[11.84,11.9,"in,"],[12.36,12.96,"ballin'"],[12.98,13.0,"[00:13.04]"],[13.04,13.38,"Fucking"],[13.42,13.68,"hoes,"],[13.76,13.84,"we"],[13.9,14.02,"ain't"],[14.08,14.76,"calling"],[15.04,15.1,"or"],[15.16,15.54,"talking"],[15.56,15.58,"[00:15.72]"],[15.72,15.8,"They"],[15.88,16.22,"follow"],[16.28,16.38,"us,"],[16.42,16.52,"they"],[16.58,16.68,"get"],[16.72,16.78,"to"],[16.86,17.54,"stalking"],[17.56,17.78,"[00:17.98]"],[17.98,18.06,"She"],[18.12,18.28,"gon'"],[18.32,18.48,"top"],[18.54,18.6,"me"],[18.74,18.84,"up"],[19.04,19.18,"right"],[19.26,19.62,"after"],[19.68,19.68,"I"],[19.72,20.1,"park"],[20.18,20.28,"it"],[20.3,20.44,"[00:20.64]"],[20.64,20.72,"She"],[20.84,20.96,"asked"],[21.02,21.08,"to"],[21.14,21.22,"hit"],[21.28,21.32,"my"],[21.48,21.76,"blunt,"